      "text": "Saving Throw DC 18 Fortitude save\n\nMaximum Duration 4 rounds\n\nStage 1 1d6 poison damage and Off-Guard (1 round)\n\nStage 2 1d6 poison damage, off-guard, and Clumsy 1 (1 round)"
